WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.430
Put the sight roots to work today.

00:00:02.430 --> 00:00:05.980
Then the sound alike words again, sorted a new way:

00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:10.240
is the word a thing, an action, or two words squeezed?

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:12.380
Say it in a sentence to check.

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:14.990
Then five new words in the spyglass.
